      <title>Chicago To Celebrate 189 Years with Birthday Party  in McKinley Park</title>
      <link>https://mckinleypark.news/news/7840-chicago-to-celebrate-189-years-with-birthday-party-in-mckinley-park</link>
      <description>The 3rd Annual Chicago's Birthday Party will bring together celebrants to sing Happy Birthday to Chicago in multiple languages on Wednesday, March 4, the 189th anniversary of Chicago's founding. 3rd annual event celebrates Chicago's founding on Wednesday, March 4. Party sings Happy Birthday to Chicago in multiple languages. Attendees enjoy performances, cake and refreshments at free event.</description>
